are a ton of big events like the Tournament

00:11:04.329 --> 00:11:08.970
of Harrenhaal and all the different wars that
we only know a little about. I'll be sure

00:11:08.970 --> 00:11:12.180
to do a bunch of bonus videos when it comes
out in October.

